	(text "EN2 = 1, EN1 = 0 selects the R_ILIM input limit (1610/1.62k = 0.99 A). R12 = 45.3k gives a 6.0 h safety timer (10 x 48 s/kohm); the legal window is 18-72k. ITERM" (at 53.06 325.12 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "e778db46-2d9c-5aae-acdd-18298ff1871a"))
	(text "is left open on purpose: pin 15 is ITERM on the '74 and open selects the 10% default. VSYS is the power-path output and feeds the LDO AND the motor, so the toy" (at 53.06 327.78 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "a2771d50-1774-5267-90ae-76ef834b9843"))
	(text "runs on the cable with a flat cell. The PowerPad carries up to 1.0 W and must go to a stitched pour. J2 is the cell." (at 53.06 330.44 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "5474d206-d44e-5988-8362-447197309882"))
