	(text "Two identical PWM channels: AO3400A low side (30 mOhm from a 3.3 V gate), B5819W 1 A Schottky across each motor for the off-time current," (at 465.9 205.74 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "9845edfa-01a1-5c70-b3f3-31ecdbd2490e"))
	(text "2 x 22 u of bulk at the connector so the PWM ripple stays off the LDO's input. R41/R43 matter: an nRF GPIO floats from reset until" (at 465.9 208.4 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "435d5c16-bbd9-5158-b112-63d74711af6a"))
	(text "firmware drives it, and a floating gate is a toy that buzzes on the bench. J4 is one 4-way JST PH for both leads: 1 VSYS, 2 M1, 3 VSYS, 4" (at 465.9 211.06 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "3d555a52-0228-543b-bbef-1a649d16208d"))
	(text "M2. Each channel is sized for 1 A." (at 465.9 213.72 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "2e450fbb-7eb7-5d4a-b07e-61bfb1f37c50"))
	(polyline (pts (xy 460.9 76.76) (xy 608.996 76.76) (xy 608.996 218.72) (xy 460.9 218.72) (xy 460.9 76.76))
		(stroke (width 0.1524) (type dash))
		(uuid "66493ed3-91f1-59dc-aeaa-3de0faf83c78"))
	(text "Block 4 — motors: two low-side FET channels from VSYS" (at 462.17 75.16 0)
		(effects (font (size 2.2 2.2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "e6649385-25d4-562d-a6d7-2fcfd1fa200a"))
