	(text "The HX711 runs WITHOUT its analog regulator: VSUP tied to AVDD, VFB to ground, BASE and VBG open (datasheet, Power Supply Options). XI = 0 selects the on-chip oscillator; RATE =" (at 439.9 373.38 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "73673cc6-1331-5de7-b59f-3010983e6b99"))
	(text "DVDD is 80 SPS. Full scale is +-0.5 AVDD/128 = +-12.9 mV; a 2 mV/V cell on 3.3 V excitation gives 6.6 mV. The whole rail is switched (U5) because a 350 ohm bridge draws 9.4 mA" (at 439.9 376.04 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "84be499f-0133-5253-a3d5-2f42888c81d6"))
	(text "forever; DVDD is therefore switched too, so firmware must tristate HX_SCK before gating, and R55 caps the current into an unpowered pin if it does not. QOD to VOUT or the rail" (at 439.9 378.7 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "b8c417e1-2d07-5d8b-b48d-9dc6fccb3ee0"))
	(text "never discharges; 100k so ON cannot float. J5: E+ A- A+ E-." (at 439.9 381.36 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "50596eea-ea75-5485-a8e1-71e5cca53b0e"))
	(polyline (pts (xy 418.4 229.16) (xy 623.316 229.16) (xy 623.316 386.36) (xy 418.4 386.36) (xy 418.4 229.16))
		(stroke (width 0.1524) (type dash))
		(uuid "d71068ac-42d0-5c95-a8e2-7b72953020f0"))
	(text "Blocks 5 + 6 — switched sensor rail, HX711 load-cell ADC and port" (at 419.67 227.56 0)
